{"xson":[{"/iati-activities/iati-activity":[{"/activity-date":[{"@iso-date":"2009-12-17","@type":"2"},{"@iso-date":"2015-06-30","@type":"4"}],"/activity-status@code":"4","/collaboration-type@code":"2","/contact-info":[{"/department/narrative":[{"1":"WCA","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/email":[{"1":"f.messan@ifad.org"}],"/job-title/narrative":[{"1":"Country Director","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/organisation/narrative":[{"1":"International Fund for Agricultural Development","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/person-name/narrative":[{"1":"Messan, Fumilayo Hermann","@xml:lang":"EN"}],"/telephone":[{"1":"+390654591"}],"/website":[{"1":"http://www.ifad.org"}],"@type":"1"}],"/default-aid-type":[{"@code":"C01","@vocabulary":"1"}],"/default-tied-status@code":"5","/description":[{"/narrative":[{"1":"The overall goal is to promote sustainable improvements in food security and in the livelihoods of small farmers in the central and north-eastern regions. The technical objectives are to: (i) restore the productive assets of destitute farmers and their groups; and (ii) rehabilitate or build essential community infrastructures to support production, marketing and value-added generation for local food value chains.\nIn addition to furthering PRSP goals, the project will help the Government re establish an enabling environment for a steady return to national food self-sufficiency.\"Key project objectivesThe overall goal is to promote sustainable improvements in food security and in the livelihoods of small farmers in the central and north-eastern regions. The technical objectives are to: (i) restore the productive assets of destitute farmers and their groups; and (ii) rehabilitate or build essential community infrastructures to support production, marketing and value-added generation for local food value chains.Policy and institutional objectivesIn addition to furthering PRSP goals, the project will help the Government re establish an enabling environment for a steady return to national food self-sufficiency.","@x